  "text": "Kiosk-only Flow QA\nKIOSK ADMIN\nKiosk-only Flow QA — Main Branch\nCtrl+K\nAssistant\nLogout\nBranch\nChoose branch\nAll restaurant · overview\nKiosk-only Flow QA — Main Branch · MAIN\nOrders, tables, inventory and devices belong to this branch.\nDAILY\nToday\nOrders\nMenu\nDevices & sync\nOPERATIONS\nKIOSK MANAGEMENT\nQR ORDERING\nSETUP\nMenu Templates\nCustomisations & Tax\nOffers & Coupons\nPayments & Payouts\nReceipt & E-Bill\nPrinters & Devices\nStaff & Roles (RBAC)\nKiosk Settings\nSubscription Plans\nAudit Trail Logs\nBackup & Restore\nHelp & Support\nApp Downloads\nShared menu options & tax\nKiosk-only Flow QA · Kiosk-only Flow QA — Main Branch\n\nChanges affect dishes using these options or tax groups across your restaurant. Review totals and publish the menu after editing.\n\nCustomisations & Tax\n\nChoices guests can add to a dish (cheese, size, spice) and the tax each dish carries. Attach them to dishes in Menu & Categories.\n\nGuest menu\n\nGuests who scan a QR code see the menu you last published, never a half-finished edit. Live now: version none yet.\n\nUnpublished changes\nPublish to guests\nPreview what guests will see\nCustomisation groups\nNew group\n\nNo customisation groups yet. Guests can only order dishes as they are.\n\nTax groups\nNew tax group\n\nNo tax groups. Dishes are sold without tax until you add one.\n\nJAMAN AI\nACTIVE\nDisplay",
